@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
participant "Student / Browser" as Browser
participant "Nuxt client" as Nuxt
participant "Nitro routing" as Nitro
participant "Node service" as Node
participant "Agent SDK runtime" as Sdk
participant "Claude API" as Claude
Browser -> Nuxt : 1. Run prompt
Nuxt -> Nitro : 2. POST to same-origin API
Nitro -> Node : 3. Invoke Nitro Node handler
Node -> Node : 4. Validate bounded JSON input
Node -> Sdk : 5. Start real SDK runtime
Sdk -> Claude : 6. Exchange messages with Claude
loop streamed SDK messages
Sdk -> Node : 7. Project safe SDK message
Node -> Nuxt : 8. Flush and pipe SSE bytes
Nuxt -> Nuxt : 9. Update Vue timeline
end
alt complete
Sdk -> Node : 10. Normalize final SDK result
Nuxt -> Nuxt : 11. Validate final result event
Nuxt -> Browser : 12. Render safe colored Markdown
Node -> Nuxt : 13. Complete result plus done
else failure
Node -> Nuxt : 14. Send safe stream failure
Nuxt -> Browser : 15. Show recoverable error
else missing key or invalid input
Node -> Nuxt : 16. Reject missing server key
end
@enduml
